{"type":"text","timestamp":1790402719086,"sessionID":"ses_f23b3ff73ffe2Hb5TEFtKuSgq6","part":{"id":"prt_0dc516d4d0015klpJpSL3oxXGL","messageID":"msg_0dc512cd4001015xLsLYneLm66","sessionID":"ses_f23b3ff73ffe2Hb5TEFtKuSgq6","type":"text","text":"The scene uses body layers `1` and `2` for player/enemy units, matching the requested detector masks. I’ll add the detector with its own layer/mask configuration, use a scene base range of `32`, and keep target selection independent of overlap so `find_target()` always chooses the closest opposing group member.","time":{"start":1790402719053,"end":1790402719056},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0bde7c22bade44cd016ab7609e86e881908338e99c096425a0","phase":"commentary"}}}}
